# Example iv: a robot dog patrols a factory at night and raises an alert at hot spots.
# Cleaned up from spec-source/URITP - Google Docs.pdf, following spec/DECISIONS.md:
#   A4  80cdeg became 80deg_c
#   A10 capture and save as are one statement
#   A11 repeat for 30min is not URITP. Instead the loop checks the time after
#       each round, so the last round always finishes before the patrol stops.
# As in the original, the dog goes back to its charger at the end of every round.

robot dog = connect("plant:quad-1")

repeat forever:
    for checkpoint in route.night_patrol:
        move dog.base to checkpoint
        if dog.sense("thermal").max > 80deg_c:
            alert "Hot spot at {checkpoint.name}"
            capture dog.camera save as "hotspot.jpg"
    move dog.base to places.charger
    if now() >= 30min:
        break
